  "content": "<h1>Maid Restaurant 女僕餐廳</h1><blockquote>\n  <p>一個為《東方小小女僕》設計的附加模組，讓女僕能自動烹飪與上菜。</p>\n</blockquote><p>![Minecraft](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fMinecraft-Java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-Java</a> Edition-brightgreen) ![Forge](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/</a> Forge | NeoForge  -1.20.1 | 1.21.1-orange) ![License](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimg.shields.io%252fbadge%252fLicense-BSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://img.shields.io/badge/License-BSD</a> -blue)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/RTiyYo0U/images/af8ed07134840c6b8c169185f185101bbbf50825.png\" alt=\"alt text\"></p><h2>簡介</h2><p>這是一款為 Minecraft Java 版開發的模組。本模組致力於透過女僕的團隊合作，實現餐廳風格的自動化體驗。</p><h2>特色</h2><ul>\n<li>女僕團隊協作烹飪與上菜。</li>\n<li>支援模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kaleidoscope-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaleidoscope Cookery</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmers' Delight</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bakeries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bakeries</a>。</li>\n</ul><h2>授權協議</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/MasterMarisa/MaidRestaurant/blob/main/LICENSE.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSD 3-Clause License</a></p><h2>意見回饋與建議</h2><p>若在使用過程中遇到問題或有改進建議，請透過以下方式與我們聯繫：</p><ul>\n<li>🐛 <a href=\"https://github.com/MasterMarisa/MaidRestaurant/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues</a> - 提交錯誤報告</li>\n<li>💡 <a href=\"https://github.com/MasterMarisa/MaidRestaurant/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Issues</a> - 功能建議、討論與交流</li>\n</ul><h2>開發者</h2><p><strong>KomeijiMarisa</strong></p>",
